  "description": "Change the user's standing notification preferences. `key` is one of: never_mute_sender, never_mute_group, never_mute_business, mute_promotions, dnd_window, auto_pay_sender. For the list keys `value` is the id or phone number to add (prefix with 'remove:' to remove); mute_promotions takes true/false; dnd_window takes HH:MM-HH:MM. Use when a message states a standing instruction.",
